e acting by industry professionals.<br>Explore many unique locations and photograph/catalog the wildlife on display.<br>Bond with the Monster Girls in their unique environments, and experience new sensations!<br>Customize your experience with many sexual Flavors on offer! A veritable Anthro delight! <br>Complete your Encyclopedia and Discover all the Secrets! A rewarding collect-a-thon.<br>Day or Night. Rain, Storms, or Sunshine! Sapphire Island changes depending on the dynamic weather.<br>Share your Snaps! All photos taken produce shareable images, perfect for showing off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Answer the call of the wild and experience the incredibly unique adventure of Sapphire Safari!</p>",
